  memo init                      create the chat (the store directory)
  memo wake [FROM EPOCH]         print the view as <chat>...</chat>
  memo note [--kind K] [TEXT|-]  append one message (kind K, default note)
  memo zoom ID N                 open line ID+N; N=1 gives message ID whole
